  # =================================================================
  #  Passage outline, traced from the SexyTopo sketch in
  #  sketch/C10.ee.xvi (51 short strokes, 891 points).
  #
  #  An extended elevation is essentially a profile -- one ceiling
  #  height and one floor height per distance along the passage -- so
  #  rather than trying to chain the strokes end to end (which jumps
  #  between distant strokes and produces wild excursions), the points
  #  are binned by x at 0.44 m and the highest and lowest in each
  #  bin taken as ceiling and floor.
  #
  #  One 9-point stroke lying 10-13 m below the centreline was dropped
  #  as a stray: the cave's whole vertical range is 4 m.
  #
  #  Smoothed once only -- lighter than the cross-sections, because a
  #  profile carries real detail worth keeping.
  # =================================================================

